const content="<section class=\"sn-page\"><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Our network sponsors</p><h1>Featured sponsors</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Explore our sponsors through life aboard an engine-maintained yacht. Each company has its own feature written for Marine Diesel Engine.</p><div class=\"sn-grid\"><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/boateye360/logo.webp\" alt=\"BoatEye360 logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">BoatEye360</a></h2><p>BoatEye360 supplies full-colour marine night-vision cameras for spotting vessels, markers and floating objects when light is limited.</p><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/captain-matt/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"Captain Matt logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Captain Matt</a></h2><p>Captain Matt takes enquiries for engineering, captaincy, deliveries and vessel operations, alongside private Sydney Harbour charters through Exclusive Boats.</p><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/easy-inflatables/logo.webp\" alt=\"Easy Inflatables logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Easy Inflatables</a></h2><p>Easy Inflatables sells Australian-designed Aerowave boats for tender duties, fishing and family outings.</p><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/ferosticker/logo.webp\" alt=\"FeroSticker logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">FeroSticker</a></h2><p>FeroSticker makes compact heat-activated devices that release fire-suppressing aerosol into suitable enclosed spaces.</p><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/brand/partners/flying-fish.webp\" alt=\"Flying Fish Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Flying Fish Sailing</a></h2><p>Flying Fish Sailing offers diesel-engine, maintenance and electrical-system courses alongside sailing tuition in Sydney.</p><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/honu/logo.webp\" alt=\"Honu Paddleboards logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Honu</a></h2><p>Honu makes Australian-designed inflatable paddleboards for relaxed outings, touring and surf.</p><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/logo.svg\" alt=\"Mainstay Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Mainstay Sailing</a></h2><p>Mainstay Sailing offers hands-on RYA courses and private tuition from Airlie Beach.</p><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/shakesure/logo.webp\" alt=\"ShakeSure logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">ShakeSure</a></h2><p>ShakeSure supplies anchor chain, rodes and accessories with a focus on strength, corrosion resistance and windlass fit.</p><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/sos-marine/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"SOS Marine logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">SOS Marine</a></h2><p>SOS Marine manufactures lifejackets, life rafts, man-overboard markers and recovery products.</p><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/survival-official-logo.png\" alt=\"SURVIVAL First Aid Kits logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">SURVIVAL</a></h2><p>SURVIVAL supplies marine first-aid kits that keep dressings, bandages and other items organised together.</p><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">Read our feature →</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/water-makers-australia/logo.webp\" alt=\"Water Makers Australia logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Water Makers Australia</a></h2><p>Water Makers Australia supplies marine reverse-osmosis systems that turn seawater into fresh water.</p><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Read our feature →</a></article></div></section>";
